course: dictionary
lesson: 13846
title: Words from stories and beliefs
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A jinni is a spirit made of fire. People cannot see it, and it can be good or bad. In old stories, a jinni often lives in a lamp or a bottle and can grant wishes. Each jinni in those stories is a magical character.
explain: Read this: «The jinni rose out of the lamp in a cloud of smoke.» The words lamp and smoke are clues. A spirit is not a person, so you know a jinni is something magical, not an ordinary man.
explain: Jinni has other spellings and forms. The plural is jinn, and you may also see djinn or genie. In the Arabian Nights story of Aladdin, the jinni is called a genie, so both words point to the same magical being.
fact: A jinni is a spirit made of fire, and people cannot see it.
fact: A jinni can be good or bad.
fact: More than one jinni is called jinn.
fact: «Genie» is another word for a jinni in stories.
fact: In Arabic and Muslim tradition, jinn are real beings; in stories they are magical characters.
exercise: «The jinni was made of fire, and nobody could see it.» What is a jinni made of? | Water | Stone | Wood | *Fire
exercise: «When Aladdin rubbed the lamp, a jinni came out and offered him a wish.» What does a jinni often do in stories? | *Grants wishes | Sings in the school choir | Swims in the sea | Cooks dinner for the king
exercise: «The genie in the bottle was happy to help.» Find and copy one word that means the same as jinni. | bottle | happy | *genie | help
test: «In Arabic tradition, a jinni is a spirit made of fire, and it can be good or bad.» Can a jinni be good? | No, they are only made of water | *Yes, it can be good or bad | Only in winter | No, jinn are always cruel
test: «In Kipling's story, the Djinn in charge of All Deserts gave the lazy Camel a hump.» What did the Djinn give the lazy Camel? | A new saddle | A golden crown | A pair of boots | *A hump
exam: «A jinni is also called a genie, and more than one jinni is called jinn.» What is another name for a jinni? | Camel | *Genie | Carpet | Tiger
